hadiths[35]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1537","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid informed him that Umar ibn al-Khattab came out to them. He said"
"1538","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Umar ibn al-Khattab asked advice about a man drinking wine. Ali ibn Abi Talib said to him"
"1539","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he was asked about the hadd of the slave for wine. He said"
"1540","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1541","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1542","Yahya related to me from Malik from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Yaqub from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1543","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1544","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Hubab al-Ansari from Abu Qatada al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah"
"1545","Yahya related to me from Malik from ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha"
"1546","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1547","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1548","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ibn Wala al-Misri asked Abdullah ibn Abbas about what is squeezed from the grapes. Ibn Abbas replied"
"1549","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1550","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that Waqid ibn Amr ibn Sad ibn Muadh informed him from Mahmud ibn Labid al- Ansari that when Umar ibn al-Khattab went to ash-Sham"
"1551","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that some men from Iraq said to him"
"1652","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that Umar ibn al- Khattab said"
"1653","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ayyub ibn Abi Tamim that Ibn Sirin said"
"1654","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar wore garments dyed with red earth and dyed with saffron"
"1655","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1656","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha the wife of the Prophet"
"1657","Yahya related to me from Malik from Alqama ibn Abi Alqama that his mother said"
"1658","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muslim ibn Abi Maryam from Abu Salih that Abu Hurayra said"
"1659","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Ibn Shihab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1660","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1661","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1662","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi and Abdullah ibn Dinar and Zayd ibn Aslam that all of them informed him from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1663","Yahya related to me from Malik from al Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman that his father said"
"1664","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Bakr ibn Nafi from his father Nafi"
"1665","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1666","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1667","Yahya related to me from Malik from his paternal uncle Abu Suhayl ibn Malik from his father that Kab al-Ahbar said to a man who took off his sandals"
"1668","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj that Abu Hurayra said"
"1669","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab saw a silk robe at the door of the mosque. He said"
"1670","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha said"
"1671","Yahya related to me from Malik that Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman heard Anas ibn Malik say"